teacher_info.cancel_policy:
// CANCELLATION POLICY //
Please let me know if you need to change the day or time of the lesson at least 24 hours before. Lessons which are not attended by the student without notice at least 24 hours before will be charged. 

//LATENESS POLICY//
If you are going to be late for the lesson please inform me by Italki or Skype. I will wait for 15 minutes maximum if you do not inform me. If you are late, the lesson will end at the original time scheduled so I can be on time for other students. Many thanks for your understanding.
